
========================================================================
  is-master-extras -- Master-labs analysis container
========================================================================
  Ships: binwalk, squashfs-tools, qemu-user-static, gdb, radare2, tshark,
         nmap, scapy (incl. scada.goose), stix2, boofuzz, pymodbus, asyncua

  Not shipped: Ghidra (install on host -- it is a graphical app).

  Useful mounts:
    /labs/master     -> master/labs/ on the host (read-only)
    /labs/captures   -> shared PCAP capture directory
    /labs/firmware   -> drop firmware samples here for §01 (RW)

